<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '26px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>局部粗筛：砍掉“看着像、其实没对上”的候选</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>06 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '8px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>对 20 个候选各跑一次轻量局部匹配，按能对上的关键点数排序，只把前 5 个留给精确匹配。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 600, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11 }}>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输入</b>　① 给出的 20 个候选帧</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>做法</b>　XFeat 提稀疏关键点，只比坐标一致性，得到内点对数 |M_ij|</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输出</b>　5 个候选（外观像 ＋ 确实对上了点）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>关键取值</b>　保留 K′ = 5 个　·　约 0.5 ms / 对</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>这一步故意用“便宜但粗糙”的特征：它的任务只是排序，不是定论</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 580, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Image src="figs/fig2_xfeat.png" style={{ width: 580, height: 362 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 5 }}>图 2　20 个候选按内点数排序，只有前 5 个进入下一级。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '12px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '10px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Image src="formula/f06.png" style={{ width: 197.5, height: 30.5 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 3 }}>淘汰的正是纯外观检索的典型假阳性：两个角落都“长得像窗台”，但一个点都对不上。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '10px 40px 12px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>三级串联的意义：候选集 1000 → 20 → 5 → 1，贵的操作只作用在极小的集合上。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
